'''Worker''' was introduced as a {{TCG|Supporter card}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the English Sword & Shield Series (the Japanese Sword & Shield Era). It was first released in the Japanese {{TCG|Paradigm Trigger}} expansion and the English {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion, with artwork by [[Sanosuke Sakuma]]. It was also released as a {{TCG|Full Art card}} and {{TCG|Secret card}} in the same Japanese and English expansions, with artwork by [[Yuu Nishida]]. It allows the player to draw three cards, then discard a {{TCG|Stadium card}} in play.
